@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy policy";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
<p class="text-muted">How information is used in the ApexPost Counter Platform.</p>

<section class="card card-body policy-card">
    <h2 class="h5">Operational information</h2>
    <p>Information entered by staff supports branch operations such as sales, inventory adjustments, shipping, and money orders. Access to administration and reporting features depends on the staff member's assigned role.</p>

    <h2 class="h5">Identity verification</h2>
    <p class="mb-0">Money order document details are used for the simulated identity check. Raw document identifiers are not stored.</p>
</section>
